   "source": [
    "# 非可逆对称性入门\n",
    "\n",
    "本教程介绍非可逆对称性的概念，这是范畴对称性的核心特征。\n",
    "\n",
    "## 学习目标\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 理解传统对称性的局限\n",
    "2. 掌握范畴对称性的定义\n",
    "3. 学习非可逆对称性的例子\n",
    "4. 理解对称性缺陷"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from matplotlib.patches import Circle, FancyArrowPatch, Rectangle, FancyBboxPatch\n",
    "from matplotlib.lines import Line2D\n",
    "import networkx as nx\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "\n",
    "sys.path.append('../src')\n",
    "from categorical_symmetry import FibonacciSymmetry, Z2Symmetry\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.style.use('seaborn-v0_8-darkgrid')\n",
    "np.set_printoptions(precision=4, suppress=True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 传统对称性 vs 范畴对称性\n",
    "\n",
    "### 传统对称性（群）\n",
    "\n",
    "**例子**: Z₂对称性\n",
    "- 对象: {e, g}\n",
    "- 乘法: g×g = e\n",
    "- **可逆**: 每个元素都有逆\n",
    "- **阿贝尔**: g×h = h×g\n",
    "\n",
    "### 范畴对称性\n",
    "\n",
    "**例子**: Fibonacci对称性\n",
    "- 对象: {1, τ}\n",
    "- 融合: τ×τ = 1 + τ\n",
    "- **非可逆**: τ没有逆元！\n",
    "- **非阿贝尔**: 多融合通道"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 比较Z₂和Fibonacci\n",
    "z2 = Z2Symmetry()\n",
    "fib = FibonacciSymmetry()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"传统对称性: Z₂\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*60)\n",
    "z2.print_info()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n\\n范畴对称性: Fibonacci\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*60)\n",
    "fib.print_info()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 可视化比较\n",
    "def compare_symmetries():\n",
    "    fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(16, 7))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Z₂ (可逆)\n",
    "    ax1.set_xlim(0, 10)\n",
    "    ax1.set_ylim(0, 10)\n",
    "    ax1.axis('off')\n",
    "    ax1.set_title('Z₂ Symmetry (Invertible)', \n",
    "                 fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 单位元\n",
    "    e_circle = Circle((3, 5), 0.5, color='lightblue', ec='black', lw=3)\n",
    "    ax1.add_patch(e_circle)\n",
    "    ax1.text(3, 5, 'e', ha='center', va='center', \n",
    "            fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # g元素\n",
    "    g_circle = Circle((7, 5), 0.5, color='lightcoral', ec='black', lw=3)\n",
    "    ax1.add_patch(g_circle)\n",
    "    ax1.text(7, 5, 'g', ha='center', va='center',\n",
    "            fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 乘法\n",
    "    arrow1 = FancyArrowPatch((3.5, 5), (6.5, 5),\n",
    "                            arrowstyle='<->', lw=3, color='green')\n",
    "    ax1.add_patch(arrow1)\n",
    "    ax1.text(5, 5.7, 'g × g = e', ha='center', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold',\n",
    "            bbox=dict(boxstyle='round', facecolor='yellow', alpha=0.8))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 说明\n",
    "    ax1.text(5, 2.5, '✓ Invertible: g⁻¹ = g', ha='center', \n",
    "            fontsize=11, color='green', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    ax1.text(5, 1.8, '✓ Abelian: g×h = h×g', ha='center',\n",
    "            fontsize=11, color='green', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    ax1.text(5, 1.1, '✓ Group structure', ha='center',\n",
    "            fontsize=11, color='green', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Fibonacci (非可逆)\n",
    "    ax2.set_xlim(0, 10)\n",
    "    ax2.set_ylim(0, 10)\n",
    "    ax2.axis('off')\n",
    "    ax2.set_title('Fibonacci Symmetry (Non-invertible)',\n",
    "                 fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 单位元\n",
    "    one_circle = Circle((3, 6.5), 0.5, color='lightblue', ec='black', lw=3)\n",
    "    ax2.add_patch(one_circle)\n",
    "    ax2.text(3, 6.5, '1', ha='center', va='center',\n",
    "            fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # tau元素\n",
    "    tau_circle = Circle((7, 6.5), 0.5, color='orange', ec='black', lw=3)\n",
    "    ax2.add_patch(tau_circle)\n",
    "    ax2.text(7, 6.5, 'τ', ha='center', va='center',\n",
    "            fontsize=14, fontweight='bold', color='white')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 融合（非对称）\n",
    "    arrow2 = FancyArrowPatch((7.5, 6.3), (7.5, 4),\n",
    "                            arrowstyle='->', lw=3, color='red')\n",
    "    ax2.add_patch(arrow2)\n",
    "    ax2.text(8.5, 5, 'τ × τ', ha='center', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 结果\n",
    "    result_box = FancyBboxPatch((4.5, 2.5), 3, 1.2,\n",
    "                               boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.1\",\n",
    "                               facecolor='lightyellow', \n",
    "                               edgecolor='black', linewidth=2)\n",
    "    ax2.add_patch(result_box)\n",
    "    ax2.text(6, 3.1, '1 + τ', ha='center', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 说明\n",
    "    ax2.text(5, 1.5, '✗ Non-invertible: τ⁻¹ does not exist!',\n",
    "            ha='center', fontsize=11, color='red', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    ax2.text(5, 0.8, '✗ Non-abelian: Multiple channels',\n",
    "            ha='center', fontsize=11, color='red', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    ax2.text(5, 0.1, '✓ Fusion category structure',\n",
    "            ha='center', fontsize=11, color='green', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "    return fig\n",
    "\n",
    "compare_symmetries()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 为什么需要非可逆对称性？\n",
    "\n",
    "### 物理动机\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **拓扑缺陷**: 在某些系统中，对称性操作本身可以有拓扑荷\n",
    "2. **对偶性**: 某些对偶映射是非可逆的\n",
    "3. **高能物理**: QCD中的色禁闭可能涉及非可逆对称性\n",
    "4. **共形场论**: 某些CFT具有非可逆对称性\n",
    "\n",
    "### 数学优势\n",
    "\n",
    "- 更丰富的结构\n",
    "- 统一框架\n",
    "- 新的分类方案"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 验证τ的非可逆性\n",
    "print(\"验证Fibonacci对称性的非可逆性\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*60)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n问题: 是否存在对象x使得 τ × x = 1？\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n检查所有可能:\")\n",
    "\n",
    "phi = (1 + np.sqrt(5)) / 2\n",
    "\n",
    "fusion_results = {\n",
    "    ('tau', '1'): 'tau',\n",
    "    ('tau', 'tau'): '1 + tau'\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "for (a, b), result in fusion_results.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"  τ × {b} = {result}\")\n",
    "    if result == '1':\n",
    "        print(f\"    → {b}是τ的逆元\")\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        print(f\"    → {b}不是τ的逆元\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n结论: τ × x = 1 无解！\")\n",
    "print(\"因此 τ 是非可逆的。\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n这有什么后果？\")\n",
    "print(\"-\"*60)\n",
    "print(\"1. τ操作不能被'撤销'\")\n",
    "print(\"2. 对称性作用是单向的\")\n",
    "print(\"3. 相结构更加丰富\")\n",
    "print(\"4. 需要新的数学工具（范畴论）\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 量子维数\n",
    "\n",
    "### 定义\n",
    "\n",
    "对称性对象a的**量子维数** $d_a$ 描述它的\"大小\"或\"自由度\"。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 性质\n",
    "\n",
    "对于**群对称性**: $d_g = 1$ (所有群元素)\n",
    "\n",
    "对于**Fibonacci**: \n",
    "- $d_1 = 1$\n",
    "- $d_\\tau = \\phi = \\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}$ (黄金比例!)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 量子维数的物理意义\n",
    "print(\"量子维数分析\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*60)\n",
    "\n",
    "d_1 = 1\n",
    "d_tau = phi\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nd_1 = {d_1:.6f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"d_τ = {d_tau:.6f} = φ\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nφ的特殊性质:\")\n",
    "print(f\"  φ² = {phi**2:.6f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  φ + 1 = {phi + 1:.6f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  φ² = φ + 1? {np.abs(phi**2 - (phi + 1)) < 1e-10}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n融合规则验证:\")\n",
    "print(f\"  τ × τ = 1 + τ\")\n",
    "print(f\"  d_τ × d_τ = d_1 + d_τ\")\n",
    "print(f\"  {d_tau:.6f} × {d_tau:.6f} = {d_1:.6f} + {d_tau:.6f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  {d_tau**2:.6f} = {d_1 + d_tau:.6f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  验证: {np.abs(d_tau**2 - (d_1 + d_tau)) < 1e-10}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 可视化\n",
    "fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 量子维数\n",
    "objects = ['1', 'τ']\n",
    "dims = [d_1, d_tau]\n",
    "colors = ['lightblue', 'orange']\n",
    "\n",
    "bars = ax1.bar(objects, dims, color=colors, edgecolor='black', \n",
    "              linewidth=2, alpha=0.7)\n",
    "ax1.set_ylabel('Quantum Dimension', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax1.set_title('Fibonacci Quantum Dimensions', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='y')\n",
    "\n",
    "for bar, val in zip(bars, dims):\n",
    "    height = bar.get_height()\n",
    "    ax1.text(bar.get_x() + bar.get_width()/2., height,\n",
    "            f'{val:.4f}',\n",
    "            ha='center', va='bottom', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "\n",
    "ax1.axhline(1, color='red', linestyle='--', linewidth=1.5, alpha=0.5,\n",
    "           label='Trivial (d=1)')\n",
    "ax1.legend()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 黄金比例螺旋\n",
    "theta = np.linspace(0, 4*np.pi, 1000)\n",
    "r = phi ** (theta / (2*np.pi))\n",
    "x = r * np.cos(theta)\n",
    "y = r * np.sin(theta)\n",
    "\n",
    "ax2.plot(x, y, 'orange', linewidth=2)\n",
    "ax2.set_aspect('equal')\n",
    "ax2.set_title('Golden Ratio φ Spiral\\n(φ ≈ 1.618)', \n",
    "             fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax2.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "ax2.axhline(0, color='k', linewidth=0.5)\n",
    "ax2.axvline(0, color='k', linewidth=0.5)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nφ在自然界中的出现:\")\n",
    "print(\"  • 斐波那契数列\")\n",
    "print(\"  • 贝壳螺旋\")\n",
    "print(\"  • 植物叶序\")\n",
    "print(\"  • 量子物理中的对称性！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 对称性缺陷\n",
    "\n",
    "### 概念\n",
    "\n",
    "在现代观点中，对称性操作被理解为**拓扑缺陷线**（2D）或缺陷面（3D）。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 性质\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 缺陷可以融合\n",
    "2. 缺陷有端点（对称性荷）\n",
    "3. 缺陷满足融合规则"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def visualize_defects():\n",
    "    \"\"\"可视化对称性缺陷\"\"\"\n",
    "    fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(16, 7))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 左图：单个缺陷\n",
    "    ax1.set_xlim(0, 10)\n",
    "    ax1.set_ylim(0, 10)\n",
    "    ax1.axis('off')\n",
    "    ax1.set_title('Symmetry Defect Line', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 系统\n",
    "    system_rect = Rectangle((1, 2), 8, 5, facecolor='lightblue',\n",
    "                            edgecolor='black', linewidth=2, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "    ax1.add_patch(system_rect)\n",
    "    ax1.text(5, 4.5, 'Physical System', ha='center', fontsize=12)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 缺陷线\n",
    "    ax1.plot([5, 5], [2, 7], 'r-', linewidth=4, label='τ defect')\n",
    "    ax1.text(5.5, 6, 'τ', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold', color='red')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 端点\n",
    "    endpoint = Circle((5, 7), 0.3, color='red', ec='black', lw=2)\n",
    "    ax1.add_patch(endpoint)\n",
    "    ax1.text(5, 7, '●', ha='center', va='center', \n",
    "            fontsize=16, color='white')\n",
    "    ax1.text(5, 8, 'Endpoint\\n(Charge)', ha='center', fontsize=10,\n",
    "            bbox=dict(boxstyle='round', facecolor='yellow', alpha=0.7))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 右图：缺陷融合\n",
    "    ax2.set_xlim(0, 10)\n",
    "    ax2.set_ylim(0, 10)\n",
    "    ax2.axis('off')\n",
    "    ax2.set_title('Defect Fusion: τ × τ = 1 + τ', \n",
    "                 fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 系统\n",
    "    system_rect2 = Rectangle((1, 2), 8, 5, facecolor='lightblue',\n",
    "                             edgecolor='black', linewidth=2, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "    ax2.add_patch(system_rect2)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 两条缺陷线\n",
    "    ax2.plot([3.5, 3.5], [2, 7], 'r-', linewidth=4, label='τ₁')\n",
    "    ax2.plot([6.5, 6.5], [2, 7], 'r-', linewidth=4, label='τ₂')\n",
    "    ax2.text(3, 5, 'τ', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold', color='red')\n",
    "    ax2.text(7, 5, 'τ', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold', color='red')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 融合箭头\n",
    "    arrow = FancyArrowPatch((4, 6), (6, 6),\n",
    "                           arrowstyle='<->', lw=3, color='blue')\n",
    "    ax2.add_patch(arrow)\n",
    "    ax2.text(5, 6.5, 'Fuse', ha='center', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 结果\n",
    "    result_box = FancyBboxPatch((3.5, 0.5), 3, 1,\n",
    "                               boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.1\",\n",
    "                               facecolor='lightyellow',\n",
    "                               edgecolor='black', linewidth=2)\n",
    "    ax2.add_patch(result_box)\n",
    "    ax2.text(5, 1, '1 (trivial)\\n+\\nτ (another defect)',\n",
    "            ha='center', fontsize=10, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "    return fig\n",
    "\n",
    "visualize_defects()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n缺陷线的物理解释:\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*60)\n",
    "print(\"1. 缺陷线分隔不同的对称性扇区\")\n",
    "print(\"2. 端点携带对称性荷\")\n",
    "print(\"3. 融合对应于碰撞/组合\")\n",
    "print(\"4. 非可逆 → 融合可能产生多个结果\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 总结\n",
    "\n",
    "### 关键要点\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **传统对称性** = 群 → 可逆\n",
    "2. **范畴对称性** = 融合范畴 → 可能非可逆\n",
    "3. **非可逆性** → 新物理\n",
    "4. **量子维数** → 描述对象"大小"\n",
    "5. **缺陷线** → 对称性的几何实现\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fibonacci对称性\n",
    "\n",
    "- 最简单的非可逆例子\n",
    "- τ没有逆元\n",
    "- $d_\\tau = \\phi$ (黄金比例)\n",
    "- 出现在拓扑量子计算中\n",
    "\n",
    "### 为什么重要？\n",
    "\n",
    "- 统一描述各种对称性\n",
    "- 发现新的对偶性\n",
    "- 理解拓扑相\n",
    "- SymTFT框架\n",
    "\n",
    "### 下一步\n",
    "\n",
    "- SymTFT理论\n",
    "- 对称性富集拓扑序\n",
    "- 反常和反常匹配\n",
    "- 高形式对称性\n",
    "\n",
    "## 练习\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 验证 $\\phi^2 = \\phi + 1$\n",
    "2. 证明Z₂的所有元素都可逆\n",
    "3. 计算Fibonacci的总量子维数 $\\mathcal{D}$\n",
    "4. 设计一个τ缺陷融合的实验\n",
    "\n",
    "## 参考文献\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Gaiotto, D. et al. (2015). *Generalized Global Symmetries*. JHEP.\n",
    "2. Bhardwaj, L. & Schafer-Nameki, S. (2023). *Generalized Charges*. arXiv.\n",
    "3. Freed, D. et al. (2022). *Topological Symmetry in QFT*. arXiv."
